<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 16:02:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>中国货船秘密收集信号情报：报告</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/chinese-cargo-ships-clandestinely-gather-signals-intelligence-report</link><description>&lt;p&gt;中国利用其庞大的商业船队在全球开展业务时进行间谍活动，这不足为奇。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/chinese-cargo-ships-clandestinely-gather-signals-intelligence-report"&gt;《中国货船秘密收集信号情报：报告》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;《TWZ》&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 01:05:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/chinese-cargo-ships-clandestinely-gather-signals-intelligence-report</guid></item><item><title>德国正式指责俄罗斯试图用无人机袭击乌克兰 An-124 货机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/germany-formally-accuses-russia-of-attempted-drone-strike-on-ukrainian-an-124-cargo-jet</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这一消息发布之际，德国电网也成为攻击目标，个别事件表明德国及其他地区的威胁正在扩大。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/germany-formally-accuses-russia-of-attempted-drone-strike-on-ukrainian-an-124-cargo-jet"&gt;德国正式指责俄罗斯试图用无人机袭击乌克兰 An-124 货机的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 22:45:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/germany-formally-accuses-russia-of-attempted-drone-strike-on-ukrainian-an-124-cargo-jet</guid></item><item><title>中东局势升温，航空母舰在哪里？亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰护航泰国</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/where-are-the-aircraft-carriers-uss-abraham-lincoln-escorted-to-thailand-as-the-middle-east-heats-up</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在情况不明的情况下，美国海军从乔治·华盛顿航母打击群中撤出一艘巡洋舰，护送亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰进入南海。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/where-are-the-aircraft-carriers-uss-abraham-lincoln-escorted-to-thailand-as-the-middle-east-heats-up"&gt;航空母舰在哪里？：随着中东局势升温，亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰被护送至泰国&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上首发。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:27:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/where-are-the-aircraft-carriers-uss-abraham-lincoln-escorted-to-thailand-as-the-middle-east-heats-up</guid></item><item><title>海军听起来现在想要一款十年前就被忽视的空战无人机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/navys-sounds-like-it-now-wants-the-air-combat-drone-it-notoriously-passed-over-a-decade-ago</link><description>&lt;p&gt;废弃的 X-47B 的设计初衷就是成为一种拥有重型武器能力、射程远且能够在竞争激烈的空域作战的舰载无人机。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;文章&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/navys-sounds-like-it-now-wants-the-air-combat-drone-it-notoriously-passed-over-a-decade-ago"&gt;《海军现在听起来想要一架十年前就被臭名昭著地错过了的空战无人机》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:20:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/navys-sounds-like-it-now-wants-the-air-combat-drone-it-notoriously-passed-over-a-decade-ago</guid></item><item><title>向美国陆军交付的竞争布拉德利战车替换原型（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/competing-bradley-fighting-vehicle-replacement-prototypes-delivered-to-the-u-s-army</link><description>&lt;p&gt;美国莱茵金属公司和通用动力地面系统公司正在为陆军未来的 XM30 机械化步兵战车提供供应服务。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/competing-bradley-fighting-vehicle-replacement-prototypes-delivered-to-the-u-s-army"&gt;交付给美国陆军的竞争性布拉德利战车替换原型（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 17:00:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/competing-bradley-fighting-vehicle-replacement-prototypes-delivered-to-the-u-s-army</guid></item><item><title>被美国击中的伊朗发射器中装有异国情调且高度关注的火箭发射水雷</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/iranian-launchers-struck-by-u-s-held-exotic-and-highly-concerning-rocket-delivered-sea-mines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;通过火箭在对峙距离布设雷区，使穿过该海峡的关键南部路线（现在是全球生命线）面临巨大风险。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/iranian-launchers-struck-by-u-s-held-exotic-and-highly-concerning-rocket-delivered-sea-mines"&gt;被美国击中的伊朗发射器被美国持有的异国情调且高度关注的火箭发射水雷&lt;/a&gt;首次出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 23:49:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/iranian-launchers-struck-by-u-s-held-exotic-and-highly-concerning-rocket-delivered-sea-mines</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯的“锆石”可能不是高超音速巡航导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/russias-zircon-may-not-be-a-hypersonic-cruise-missile-after-all</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌克兰的情报报告绘制了锆石的生产链，并声称识别出导弹内源自美国的电子设备。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/russias-zircon-may-not-be-a-hypersonic-cruise-missile-after-all"&gt;俄罗斯的锆石毕竟可能不是高超音速巡航导弹，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:44:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/russias-zircon-may-not-be-a-hypersonic-cruise-missile-after-all</guid></item><item><title>日本第一艘专用导弹防御战舰是一个怪物</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/japans-first-dedicated-missile-defense-warship-is-a-monster</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日本第一艘ASEV导弹防御舰刚刚安装了巨大的雷达桅杆，为这些巡洋舰大小的军舰提供了新的规模感。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/japans-first-dedicated-missile-defense-warship-is-a-monster"&gt;日本第一艘专用导弹防御战舰是怪物的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:02:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/japans-first-dedicated-missile-defense-warship-is-a-monster</guid></item><item><title>日本的ASM-3 Kai超音速巡航导弹可能具有空对空能力</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/japans-asm-3-kai-supersonic-cruise-missile-may-have-an-air-to-air-capability</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日本将 ASM-3 Kai 称为“空对地/防空”武器，这可能是针对大型高价值空中目标的新武器。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/japans-asm-3-kai-supersonic-cruise-missile-may-have-an-air-to-air-capability"&gt;日本的 ASM-3 Kai 超音速巡航导弹可能具有空对空能力的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 17:09:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/japans-asm-3-kai-supersonic-cruise-missile-may-have-an-air-to-air-capability</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯改变对乌克兰首都的导弹和无人机攻击战略</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/russia-changing-missile-and-drone-attack-strategy-on-ukrainian-captial</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌克兰局势报告：新战略优先考虑频率而不是幅度，这让民众疲惫不堪，空中防御人员精疲力尽。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/russia-changing-missile-and-drone-attack-strategy-on-ukrainian-captial"&gt;俄罗斯改变对乌克兰首都的导弹和无人机攻击战略的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:15:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/russia-changing-missile-and-drone-attack-strategy-on-ukrainian-captial</guid></item></channel></rss>